{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_02_end","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_02","title":"寂静长廊的两端","storyCode":"SS-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"6bf4b838833158dab9629dc8b1f69444358781cf644742e4c0aaeb27a41bc9e2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g8_interviewstage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位观众朋友们好！下面让我们有请今天的人气嘉宾——空小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"左边的朋友——右边的朋友——还有中间的朋友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨！我是来自塞壬唱片的，大家的偶像空~！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家的热情都很高涨啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"有这么多人喜欢我，我真的很开心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我想，肯定也有很多人是因为临时官宣的另一位嘉宾而欢呼，她同样也是我的偶像哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，大家已经等不及了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我们欢迎——若麦小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好喵呣喵呣~~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"粉丝朋友们好呀，我是若麦~见到大家我太开心了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忙碌的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"有入场凭证的才能进场！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忙碌的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"无关人士都往外面站，不要拥挤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忙碌的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"*龙门粗口*，人太多了，根本管不过来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的粉丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐......若麦小姐！我爱你们啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忙碌的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那个人冲进去了——快拦住他！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里已经完全一团乱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人实在太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......完全没有混进去的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，想进场看大明星吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜欢哪个？空，还是若麦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有办法带你进去，亲眼见到本人哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你为什么要帮我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别这么紧张嘛~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要价也不高......喏，这个数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我给不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这价格已经很低了啊！你可别想着再砍一刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你这么说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（虽然这个男人看着就很可疑，但是现在也没什么别的更好的办法了，如果错过这次机会......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（只能先相信他了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（翻找口袋）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一共只有这么多......这是我身上全部的钱，你看行不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也成！跟我来吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"员工专用通道......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，咱们就从这里进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入场凭证呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是内部人员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们怎么进去？要是被发现了怎么办？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你说了我有办法啦！你到底想不想见到明星？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）*龙门粗口*，声音太大了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）他要过来了！趁他还没发现，我们快——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你怎么在这呢？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的保安&丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是跟你说让你守着备用器材随时待命吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想着当助理就能偷懒，待会道具组临时需要备用器材咋办？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才多大年纪啊，就想着偷懒不干活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，她都吓得说不出话了，你给人家留点面子嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还傻站着干什么啊？快去会场啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，会场在那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别告诉她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就等着她找不到再跑回来求我！因为她耽误时间而造成的损失，全部从她工资里扣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，工作加油啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点走吧，别磨蹭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"唉——这年头，还真是什么活都不好干啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，你那边情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"一切正常。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pgbase_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的保安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一切正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。继续巡逻吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——头都要大了！根本忙不过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若麦的人气怎么这么高！走到哪都有这么多喜欢她的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐这样，一定也很累吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着空小姐每天起早贪黑地训练，为了回应粉丝们的爱意而四处奔波。晚上见到她时，她从来都是满脸的疲惫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐一出道就迅速走红，现在除了做主播，还要演戏、上综艺节目......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前还能看到她发练鼓的视频，现在已经很久没看到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很喜欢她，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我最开始会对架子鼓感兴趣，就是因为看了她的视频。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶尔坚持不下去的时候，还会去看她以前的那些视频。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道现在的她，还会不会像《少女鼓手》里那样开心地玩音乐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！对不起，自顾自说了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企鹅物流员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还是工作时间，保证空小姐的安全最重要！我们还是继续盯监控吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的啦，也不用那么紧张。最近从供应商那进了点新产品，可以自动识别未授权的访客——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去看看A区那两个可疑的人，准备无人机！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"狭长的走廊里，两个人像着了魔一样飞奔，而他们身后是数十架攻击型无人机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不该......不该信你！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是怪了！之前带人这么溜进来都没问题啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些监控和无人机什么时候有的？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，无人机要追上来了——再跑快点，快点啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪的声音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻......哈哈哈哈哈哈！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子发现，方才还在身边的男人突然间不见了踪影，取而代之的是一张熟悉的面孔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈——太好玩啦！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（欢乐的叫声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，你喜欢这个孩子的美梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看她沉浸在大家的爱意里，完全不想回去呢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是你搞的鬼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就说过了——既然是挑战，就不会那么轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快让我去见她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想见她倒是不难，沿着这条走廊一直往前，一直往前，就能见到啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过恐怕你现在应该考虑的是，怎么甩掉后面这些东西~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（赞同的哼唧声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在往录制现场跑，空有危险——快拦住她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可恶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子感到自己脚下的地板开始莫名变得柔软，她和前方大门的距离被无限地拉长，奔跑与噩梦一样无休无止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祐天寺，你快点给我醒过来啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟上她的动作，镜头推近——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对，再近一点，对准她的脸，移到苍白的嘴唇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“人偶存在的意义是什么？”\n“摆在精致的橱窗里，模仿着橱窗外人们的动作。”\n“用拙劣的效仿，博得人们的欢笑。”\n“人偶开心，人们欢喜。”\n“人偶悲伤，人们欢喜。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“接下来，请欣赏人偶为您带来的表演——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯器里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......完美。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g8_interviewstage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好厉害......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是天生的表演奇才啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我也是最近才能拿捏准这种感觉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天晚上对着例片，在镜子前一遍又一遍练习，尝试理解人偶的想法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"理解人偶？听起来有点奇怪呢，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐能演绎成这样，一定付出了非常多的汗水吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为我常常会觉得自己缺乏才能嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身边的大家都有着非凡的能力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些人天生含着金汤匙，早早就作为童星成名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些人即使坠入谷底，却依然散发着耀眼的光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得奔跑到力竭，才能勉强追赶上她们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的这些小聪明，在她们面前实在是一无是处啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以面对那些喜欢我的人，我唯有付出几倍几十倍的努力，才能回应他们对我这个天赋平平之人的垂青。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐......你已经非常优秀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信在座的所有人，都和我一样——大家都深爱着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......谢谢大家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"实在是让人感动啊。很有幸，今天能邀请到两位如此出色的嘉宾，与大家共度这一段欢乐的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然气氛已经到这里了，我突然想到了个有趣的点子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在节目的最后，不如两位一起演绎一次《少女鼓手》的经典场面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦&空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"按照耳机里的指示，若麦和空在自己的位置站定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g16_sunnyday_R2"},{"type":"narration","text":"蔚蓝的天空，盛夏的风携来了远方的气息。\n羽兽鸣叫。\n呼吸声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"——你快从天台上下来呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行，梦想这种东西，就是要站在最高的地方，用最大的声音喊出来呀！"},{"type":"narration","text":"展现完美无瑕的一面，是偶像的天职。\n即使有时候需要一点点谎言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是，你不是才决定买架子鼓吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"万一你之后放弃了打鼓怎么办？那不会被人笑话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经决定了，我要打一辈子鼓！打到打不动为止！"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是我放弃了鼓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的梦想是成为龙门第一——"},{"type":"narration","text":"我确实变成了众人喜爱的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，泰拉第一的鼓手！"},{"type":"narration","text":"这样就可以了，这样就行。这就是我想要的评价，这就是我想要的地位——\n是吗？我想要的真的是这些东西吗？\n羽兽鸣叫。\n呼吸声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"玻璃碎裂声。\n不该出现的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜晚肆意的冷风，依然无法让人清醒地思考此时发生的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"发、发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"保护好空！若麦被嫌疑人掠走了，我现在去追她们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身后传来的那一片混乱的声音，正在迅速地离她们而去。\n当若麦回过神来，才发现她们正失控地下坠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是哪门子的美梦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"失去鼓，失去伙伴，失去自己。就算得到再多人的喜欢，那还是你的梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个爱耍聪明、从不饶人的祐天寺，到底跑哪去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是、可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若麦，梦该醒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
